### GitHub Profile Summary

GitHub is a platform used by developers and students to **store, manage, share, and collaborate on software projects**. It provides features such as repositories, version control,

issue tracking, documentation, and project collaboration. A GitHub profile showcases a user's projects, contributions, programming skills, and development experience.

### Project Overview

The **Intelligent ICU Patient Monitoring System** is a healthcare-based project developed to monitor patients' vital signs continuously. The project uses sensors and software to collect and process 
parameters such as **heart rate, blood pressure, body temperature, oxygen saturation (SpO₂), and respiratory rate**.

The system displays patient data in real time and can generate alerts when abnormal readings are detected. The project source code, documentation, and related files can be maintained in a **GitHub repository**, 
making the project easy to manage, update, and share with others.

### Main Features

* Real-time patient monitoring
* Measurement of multiple vital signs
* Automatic detection of abnormal readings
* Alert/notification system
* Data visualization and storage
* Easy project management through GitHub
